WEBVTT

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:05.930
The funny guy from a Japanese movie, Itami Juzo, succeeded in making that sweet home into a Famicom movie.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.550
The five TV reporters who were trapped in a cursed mansion.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.120
It's your duty to control these five people and get as many people out of there as possible.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.000
Ah, run away! If you keep whining, you'll be killed in the mansion!

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:23.390
Be careful in the dark! A evil creature is waiting for you!

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:27.320
I don't know anything about everyone! I'm going to run away by myself!

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.520
That kind of person will be killed right away!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.750
If you don't help each other, it's impossible to escape.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.840
Even if I'm killed, you'll run away.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.930
Can you escape from the cursed mansion?

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:46.460
Five moving endings await you depending on the number of people who escaped.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.770
The adventure of love and fear.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:52.050
Sweet Home The Famicom

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.320
Give me the power of your heart.

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:02.390
Thank you.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:36.530
You're in an unstable position.

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:42.350
Yop!

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:50.600
Dad, you're late.

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:52.730
You're so clumsy.

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:55.620
Hey, Akiko.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.040
Shouldn't you go cheer him up?

00:02:58.100 --> 00:02:59.300
It's okay.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.410
It'll take some time.

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:03.600
It's impossible no matter how many times you lower your head.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.100
We'll manage somehow.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:09.970
I've told you many times.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.170
We won't let you enter Mamiya's mansion.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.620
It's on TV, so it's an exception.

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:19.470
That's too much.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:25.720
Mamiya Ichiro's painting is left in the mansion.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:28.230
It's Mamiya Ichiro's last painting.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.980
It's our duty to introduce such a valuable cultural asset to the world.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.080
I'm a persistent person, too.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:41.780
Speaking of TV, I thought that if a countryman shook his head vertically, it would be a mistake.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:43.760
Hey, what's wrong?

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:49.850
They say they want to see Mamiya-tei over there.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:53.190
Mamiya-tei? No, no, no, it won't be a problem.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:56.740
