00:32:31.650 --> 00:32:58.690
What was that?

00:33:00.320 --> 00:33:00.780
It's like a piece of jewelry.

00:33:01.340 --> 00:33:04.140
But it's not a white thing like it's in the village.

00:33:04.140 --> 00:33:05.580
It's real.

00:33:09.660 --> 00:33:13.690
I don't want it.

00:33:13.910 --> 00:33:16.190
No, Mr. Yamamura. That's a problem.

00:33:16.590 --> 00:33:17.450
Oh, my God.

00:33:17.510 --> 00:33:18.920
You remembered my name.

00:33:19.280 --> 00:33:20.140
I'm so happy.

00:33:20.420 --> 00:33:22.370
But I can't get money from a man of my life.

00:33:23.470 --> 00:33:28.480
Yes, sir.

00:33:30.120 --> 00:33:33.900
Yes, stop.

00:33:34.280 --> 00:33:36.150
Thank you very much.

00:33:36.490 --> 00:33:38.900
What are you doing with so much gas?

00:33:39.640 --> 00:33:40.820
I'm using it for a while.

00:33:41.380 --> 00:33:44.110
I'm doing a TV shoot for a while.

00:33:44.110 --> 00:33:45.280
A while?

00:33:46.220 --> 00:33:47.560
Hey, wait a minute!

00:34:02.270 --> 00:34:03.190
Okaka-chan, let's start.

00:34:03.570 --> 00:34:14.400
Taguchi-kun, make her move.

00:34:15.030 --> 00:34:16.110
Let's take a break and have some bread.

00:34:16.250 --> 00:34:16.570
Okay.

00:34:18.550 --> 00:34:19.050
Wait, wait.

00:34:20.260 --> 00:34:22.400
Let's put the camera on the wheelchair and move.

00:34:22.880 --> 00:34:23.260
Okay.

00:34:23.870 --> 00:34:24.390
Emi.

00:34:25.190 --> 00:34:25.690
Yes?

00:34:26.210 --> 00:34:27.500
Bring the wheelchair. It's outside.

00:34:28.060 --> 00:34:28.600
Okay.

00:34:41.800 --> 00:34:43.290
Huh? What is this?

00:34:43.570 --> 00:34:52.210
Are you here, Yubi-chan?

00:34:52.390 --> 00:34:52.570
Yeah.

00:34:53.290 --> 00:34:53.430
Move a bit.

00:35:05.276 --> 00:35:07.276
Thank you for watching!

00:35:24.316 --> 00:35:25.376
I broke it.

00:35:31.148 --> 00:35:32.908
I don't remember at all.

00:35:34.476 --> 00:35:36.476
It must be the mold.

00:35:36.972 --> 00:35:38.612
Thank you for your trouble.

00:35:40.012 --> 00:35:40.732
I...

00:35:41.644 --> 00:35:42.644
Will you go home?

00:36:15.804 --> 00:36:16.804
I'll be right back.

00:36:17.436 --> 00:36:17.936
Emi!

00:36:18.236 --> 00:36:18.996
I'm counting on you.

00:36:20.220 --> 00:36:21.980
But please come back soon.

00:36:22.748 --> 00:36:26.868
引き上げることになるかもしれないから荷物まとまってきなさいお父さんの分もね。

00:36:27.292 --> 00:36:28.452
Okay.

00:36:29.340 --> 00:36:29.840
How is it?

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:30.380
Are you going to get better?

00:36:30.520 --> 00:36:30.920
What?

00:36:31.040 --> 00:36:33.400
It's an electric wire.

00:36:33.840 --> 00:36:36.740
It's a little troublesome.

00:36:37.860 --> 00:36:39.860
I'll go get a tester.

00:36:40.380 --> 00:36:45.210
Did you get it?

00:36:45.370 --> 00:36:48.900
I got it.

00:36:49.120 --> 00:36:50.730
How's Asuka?

00:36:50.970 --> 00:36:52.300
It's not a big injury.

00:36:52.720 --> 00:36:54.720
But I have to take her to the hospital.

00:36:55.640 --> 00:36:57.270
But the car...

00:36:57.270 --> 00:36:59.050
I'll go to the gas station and call you.

00:37:00.190 --> 00:37:01.210
It's about 30 minutes by walk.

00:37:01.310 --> 00:37:03.590
Oh, that's fine. I'll go.

00:37:03.850 --> 00:37:05.230
No, Mr. Kado, please stay here.

00:37:05.610 --> 00:37:06.810
I have to go to do something.

00:37:07.070 --> 00:37:07.870
What do you mean?

00:37:08.110 --> 00:37:09.540
What do you mean?

00:37:09.680 --> 00:37:13.910
Mr. Kado.

00:37:13.970 --> 00:37:14.330
Yes?

00:37:14.550 --> 00:37:16.560
Don't you think it's weird?

00:37:17.380 --> 00:37:17.820
What?

00:37:19.780 --> 00:37:20.720
I'm in trouble no matter what you say.

00:37:22.700 --> 00:37:24.950
But somehow this house is weird.

00:37:25.290 --> 00:37:28.530
There's a baby buried in that place.

00:37:28.790 --> 00:37:29.230
Baby?

00:37:30.190 --> 00:37:31.460
That's right, isn't it? It's common in the countryside.

00:37:32.280 --> 00:37:34.620
That's because Asuka-chan who dug it out became like that.

00:37:34.940 --> 00:37:35.440
Asuka?

00:37:37.260 --> 00:37:39.240
She was originally a strange woman.

00:37:39.560 --> 00:37:42.360
Please, don't mess with me and listen to me properly.

00:37:44.200 --> 00:37:48.180
I have a bad feeling.

00:37:48.700 --> 00:37:59.570
If I stay here, something bad will happen.

00:38:01.240 --> 00:38:01.920
That's how I feel.

00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:02.680
Really?

00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:07.830
Do you believe in things like Tataris?

00:38:08.310 --> 00:38:10.470
I'm worried about them.

00:38:10.970 --> 00:38:14.360
Besides, Mr. Kazuo is 100 years old this year.

00:38:15.320 --> 00:38:17.940
What's so funny?

00:38:18.200 --> 00:38:19.000
It's not funny.

00:38:19.900 --> 00:38:21.320
It's actually funny.

00:38:21.840 --> 00:38:22.640
What's so funny?

00:38:23.690 --> 00:38:26.700
Akira, do you believe in things like that?

00:38:26.840 --> 00:38:29.350
Like GALT, blood type, and...

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:31.520
or Nostradamus' Great Prophecy.

00:38:31.760 --> 00:38:32.740
That's a new discovery.

00:38:33.280 --> 00:38:34.880
It's Aki's new charm.

00:38:38.140 --> 00:38:39.970
It's not strange.

00:38:40.490 --> 00:38:41.980
Why can't you listen when people are serious?

00:38:44.320 --> 00:38:46.440
I think that's very insincere.

00:38:46.740 --> 00:38:48.560
No, I meant to praise you.

00:38:49.140 --> 00:38:49.620
You can't praise me.

00:38:50.500 --> 00:38:52.260
I don't understand people's feelings at all.

00:38:52.760 --> 00:38:54.720
It's not like that. I...

00:38:54.720 --> 00:38:55.720
You don't understand.

00:38:56.830 --> 00:38:59.110
My feelings, Emi's feelings,

00:38:59.170 --> 00:38:59.970
Mr. Kazuo's feelings...

00:39:00.440 --> 00:39:01.080
I don't understand anything.

00:39:01.280 --> 00:39:03.220
How do you feel?

00:39:03.420 --> 00:39:08.140
I'm sorry.

00:39:08.440 --> 00:39:12.660
I was just thinking about it.

00:40:10.200 --> 00:40:10.660
Tsuka-san

00:42:01.050 --> 00:42:01.450
What happened?

00:42:02.940 --> 00:42:04.180
This is a lie!

00:42:04.960 --> 00:42:06.940
Emi!

00:42:48.140 --> 00:42:50.640
Oh, I'm surprised.

00:42:51.160 --> 00:42:58.780
What happened?

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:16.920
Asuka, are you in a good mood?

00:43:18.890 --> 00:43:20.820
Don't worry about it.

00:43:32.620 --> 00:43:35.190
Let's do it again.

00:45:00.156 --> 00:45:00.656
Ugh!

00:46:16.160 --> 00:46:16.360
then

00:48:00.250 --> 00:48:01.660
Let it die!

00:48:04.790 --> 00:48:07.140
Let it die!

00:49:15.480 --> 00:49:16.240
What's he up to?

00:49:17.150 --> 00:49:19.670
I'll go check it out.

00:49:19.730 --> 00:49:21.520
Wait. Don't leave me.

00:49:21.940 --> 00:49:23.720
I'm here.

00:49:27.080 --> 00:49:28.820
Then the three of us will go.

00:49:42.284 --> 00:49:44.284
Thank you for your viewing.

00:49:53.452 --> 00:49:55.452
What's wrong with you, Taori?

00:50:00.440 --> 00:50:04.530
What the hell do you think I am?

00:50:04.590 --> 00:50:05.780
I'm Kuyaotou.

00:50:06.060 --> 00:50:08.070
Kuyaotou?

00:50:08.150 --> 00:50:09.360
I'm not the one who broke your door.

00:50:11.190 --> 00:50:12.970
You broke it naturally.

00:50:13.210 --> 00:50:15.880
Mr. Yamamura, we don't know anything.

00:50:16.220 --> 00:50:19.100
Do you know Aki?

00:50:19.340 --> 00:50:21.280
Yes, Mr. Yamamura from the gas station.

00:50:22.080 --> 00:50:24.320
You must be her manager.

00:50:25.370 --> 00:50:26.250
No, I'm not.

00:50:26.330 --> 00:50:27.820
If you're done with your job, go home.

00:50:30.320 --> 00:50:32.020
You don't have the right to say that, do you?

00:50:32.120 --> 00:50:37.460
No, I have the right.

00:50:37.840 --> 00:50:41.590
What happened here?

00:50:41.590 --> 00:50:43.670
It has nothing to do with you.

00:50:43.710 --> 00:50:44.860
Anyway, go home.

00:50:45.000 --> 00:50:46.530
I can't go home because I want to go home.

00:50:46.970 --> 00:50:51.050
There are two of my friends left inside.

00:50:52.140 --> 00:50:54.010
Anyway, let's find Asuka and Tamuchi.

00:50:54.310 --> 00:50:54.650
Hey!

00:51:00.060 --> 00:51:00.760
Don't go inside the house!

00:51:01.240 --> 00:51:10.810
Hey Takuchi!

00:51:10.930 --> 00:51:12.590
Takuchi-kun!

00:51:12.690 --> 00:51:14.500
Asuka!

00:51:14.600 --> 00:51:21.650
Takuchi!

00:51:21.950 --> 00:51:28.510
Kazuo-san...

00:51:28.510 --> 00:51:29.910
After all, Yamamura-san...

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:30.680
It would be nice if you could come with us.

00:51:31.660 --> 00:51:33.830
Where is that rambunctious guy?

00:51:34.900 --> 00:51:36.320
Dad, let's go here.

00:51:37.060 --> 00:51:38.110
Don't be silly.

00:54:24.730 --> 00:54:25.150
What did you do?

00:54:25.150 --> 00:54:26.450
What did you do?

00:54:26.630 --> 00:54:28.590
Yamamura-san!

00:55:04.920 --> 00:55:05.140
What are you doing?

00:55:51.500 --> 00:55:51.740
Thank you for watching.

00:55:51.860 --> 00:55:53.970
See you soon.

00:56:00.060 --> 00:56:01.900
Hey, your dad is here.

00:56:02.280 --> 00:56:06.780
You can live with the three of us, right?

00:56:06.780 --> 00:56:17.610
What are you doing?

00:56:17.870 --> 00:56:19.660
Hurry up and live.

00:56:20.100 --> 00:56:28.820
Henry, what the hell are you?

00:56:37.070 --> 00:56:37.590
You're not a girl!

00:56:38.240 --> 00:56:39.940
What do you mean?

00:57:31.610 --> 00:57:31.870
What is it?

00:58:10.650 --> 00:58:13.530
What's wrong?

00:58:13.710 --> 00:58:15.600
What happened?

00:58:16.000 --> 00:58:21.760
30 years ago,

00:58:21.800 --> 00:58:24.650
a baby was born in my family.

00:58:26.330 --> 00:58:29.530
I was so happy.

00:58:30.800 --> 00:58:33.640
I tried to write the story of my child's growth on one side of the wall.

00:58:33.960 --> 00:58:39.320
The happiness did not last long.

00:58:39.580 --> 00:58:44.660
In the morning, Mrs. Mamiya went down to the basement as usual.

00:58:44.720 --> 00:58:48.240
I twisted the cock of the incinerator.

00:58:51.890 --> 00:58:53.060
Why did you do that?

00:58:53.200 --> 00:58:58.120
A baby who had just started walking.

00:59:00.380 --> 00:59:02.520
He was playing in the incinerator.

00:59:02.520 --> 00:59:07.280
It was already too late when the boy was dragged out.

00:59:08.840 --> 00:59:12.430
His mother also had severe burns and lost one eye.

00:59:13.050 --> 00:59:18.100
After the incident, there were many children in this area.

00:59:20.580 --> 00:59:24.370
The culprit was Mrs. Mamiya.

00:59:24.950 --> 00:59:27.060
After taking the village boy,

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:31.560
and threw it into the incinerator.

00:59:31.640 --> 00:59:34.060
Why did you do such a terrible thing?

00:59:34.420 --> 00:59:36.000
It's a child's playmate.

00:59:36.520 --> 00:59:40.640
It's lonely when a child is alone.

00:59:41.520 --> 00:59:44.740
That's why I brought a playmate.

00:59:45.960 --> 00:59:49.100
After knowing the truth,

00:59:49.600 --> 00:59:51.140
the villagers rushed to Mamia.

00:59:55.530 --> 00:59:56.410
Mamia, who was locked up,

00:59:56.410 --> 00:59:58.800
closed herself up in the incinerator.

01:00:03.960 --> 01:00:05.060
Mrs. Mamiya is dead.

01:00:07.480 --> 01:00:08.480
Ichiro is also dead soon.

01:00:08.480 --> 01:00:12.480
But Ichiro continued to draw until he died.

01:00:12.940 --> 01:00:17.020
It's the story of the Mamiya family.

01:00:18.100 --> 01:00:25.280
I have to find the meaning.

01:00:25.920 --> 01:00:26.360
What's the meaning?

01:00:30.570 --> 01:00:31.950
What's going on in this house?

01:00:32.780 --> 01:00:34.880
You guys woke up Mrs. Mamiya, who was resting in the dark.

01:00:37.260 --> 01:00:40.020
How can you say that?

01:00:40.240 --> 01:00:46.100
The darkness in the dark, the shadow, the shadow of the evil spirit has fallen.

01:00:46.580 --> 01:00:50.140
Akshay, let's go find Emi.

01:00:50.360 --> 01:00:52.890
But what should we do?

01:00:53.210 --> 01:00:55.510
We'll go to the seafront and collect the light.

01:00:56.650 --> 01:00:57.220
Oh, oh.

01:00:57.340 --> 01:00:59.930
Come on, let's go.

01:01:00.480 --> 01:01:01.600
You don't know anything, do you?

01:01:01.600 --> 01:01:03.600
Mr. Yamamura, what should we do?

01:01:03.960 --> 01:01:06.970
Emi was kidnapped by the darkness.

01:01:07.090 --> 01:01:10.000
Light it up and erase the darkness.

01:01:10.180 --> 01:01:11.560
Emi will definitely find it.

01:01:11.660 --> 01:01:12.560
I've done it all.

01:01:13.200 --> 01:01:17.060
If you do that, you'll just make the other person angry.

01:01:17.520 --> 01:01:18.440
You still don't understand?

01:01:19.110 --> 01:01:19.990
That's right. You too.

01:01:20.450 --> 01:01:22.600
Your protection wasn't useful, was it?

01:01:22.800 --> 01:01:24.190
If you light it up...

01:01:24.190 --> 01:01:26.330
If you light it up, you'll be able to cast a shadow, right?

01:01:26.410 --> 01:01:29.080
Even if I could light it up without any trouble,

01:01:30.090 --> 01:01:30.610
What will happen to the darkness inside you?

01:01:31.220 --> 01:01:32.960
There is no darkness in the fist you hold.

01:01:33.940 --> 01:01:42.890
The most important thing is concentration, the power of the heart.

01:01:43.170 --> 01:01:50.300
To make it better, the bones really break.

01:01:50.660 --> 01:01:53.880
A man is useless if he is a coward.

01:02:04.160 --> 01:02:04.540
No.

01:02:07.190 --> 01:02:17.120
Do you have any children?

01:02:20.260 --> 01:02:20.660
No.

01:02:20.840 --> 01:02:22.420
Just one?

01:02:22.660 --> 01:02:22.940
Yes.

01:02:26.410 --> 01:02:26.550
Haha.

01:02:28.820 --> 01:02:29.850
Then, it's a bit...

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:32.650
What's so difficult about it?

01:02:32.870 --> 01:02:36.380
It's not easy for a woman to win over her mother.

01:02:38.270 --> 01:02:41.860
A mother who has lost her child

01:02:41.860 --> 01:02:44.680
and a mother who has lost her child

01:02:44.680 --> 01:02:46.060
are fighting each other.

01:02:46.260 --> 01:02:49.130
It's not easy to get Emi back.

01:02:50.430 --> 01:02:52.490
You don't want me to be a father?

01:02:53.570 --> 01:02:57.640
Try crushing me.

01:03:04.540 --> 01:03:05.320
It's not the time to say that!

01:03:05.720 --> 01:03:06.960
Emi may be dead!

01:03:07.780 --> 01:03:08.680
I know where your daughter is!

01:03:10.400 --> 01:03:11.080
Calm down.

01:03:11.200 --> 01:03:18.600
It's a terrible way, but it's surprisingly useful to increase your concentration.

01:03:19.760 --> 01:03:24.480
If you close your eyes, you'll be able to see.

01:03:39.440 --> 01:03:40.860
Let's go. It's a waste of time.

01:03:41.020 --> 01:03:43.130
We can't go on like this.

01:03:43.250 --> 01:03:44.670
Emi's in danger.

01:03:44.910 --> 01:03:45.430
But...

01:04:00.570 --> 01:04:03.900
I embrace the stone

01:04:03.900 --> 01:04:08.260
The body I walk on

01:04:08.260 --> 01:04:12.480
Doesn't look like a hat

01:04:12.480 --> 01:04:17.530
The grass is covered with grass

01:04:17.530 --> 01:04:21.470
The grass is covered with grass

01:04:21.470 --> 01:04:26.740
The grass is covered with grass

01:04:27.570 --> 01:04:29.980
The grass is covered with grass

01:04:30.160 --> 01:04:34.780
If you get lost, even if you run away,

01:04:36.210 --> 01:04:37.590
I'll protect you.

01:04:39.130 --> 01:04:46.100
The old man said goodbye.

01:05:03.644 --> 01:05:05.644
Thanks for watching!

01:06:13.400 --> 01:06:13.500
No!

01:06:15.720 --> 01:06:24.480
I mean...

01:06:30.120 --> 01:06:30.640
I'll turn on the lights.

01:06:30.780 --> 01:06:32.640
If you're going to do that, bring it on.

01:07:30.280 --> 01:07:31.280
Is Emiya in here?

01:07:31.560 --> 01:07:33.770
She's in the incinerator.

01:07:34.150 --> 01:07:36.630
Emiya was captured by the ghost.

01:07:36.630 --> 01:07:40.350
Don't worry. I'll save her.

01:09:01.820 --> 01:09:18.250
You're crying. You had a happy past.

01:09:18.950 --> 01:09:22.200
You must have a lot of fun memories.

01:09:23.320 --> 01:09:26.200
Please give me back my daughter.

01:09:26.940 --> 01:09:28.820
Emi is still a child.

01:09:29.220 --> 01:09:29.900
Please give me back my daughter.

01:09:30.320 --> 01:09:33.420
Emi still needs parents. You understand, right?

01:09:33.620 --> 01:09:39.240
You're already dead. Why don't you understand that?

01:09:39.260 --> 01:09:47.180
It's okay, it's okay.

01:09:47.320 --> 01:09:50.360
Put your nails down and get out of here!

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:01.400
Emi-chan, wait! I'm coming!

01:10:02.620 --> 01:10:06.180
Who are you?

01:13:03.804 --> 01:13:05.804
Thanks for watching!

01:13:30.600 --> 01:13:30.800
Thank you.

01:14:02.720 --> 01:14:03.120
I'm coming.

01:14:03.340 --> 01:14:04.720
I'm going to go to the dark place.

01:14:05.300 --> 01:14:06.560
I'm going to go to the dark place.

01:14:12.510 --> 01:14:13.190
I'm going to go.

01:14:13.630 --> 01:14:14.270
I'm going to go.

01:14:32.780 --> 01:14:33.200
I don't get out of it!

01:15:35.050 --> 01:15:36.100
Aki-chan, are you okay?

01:15:36.240 --> 01:15:42.490
Aki-chan, I'll go.

01:15:42.910 --> 01:15:46.670
Good. Emi came out.

01:15:46.890 --> 01:15:48.920
You take Emi and run away.

01:15:49.120 --> 01:15:52.840
Even if I can't, I'll run away.

01:15:53.060 --> 01:15:56.830
If you can get back safely.

01:16:25.720 --> 01:16:26.220
I wanted to see you for a little while more.

01:16:31.760 --> 01:16:31.960
Thank you.

01:17:00.510 --> 01:17:01.150
Thank you.

01:18:10.270 --> 01:18:10.510
Please give me strength.

01:20:02.490 --> 01:20:02.550
Thank you.

01:21:32.330 --> 01:21:34.290
Don't hide in the crime scene forever!

01:21:34.410 --> 01:21:35.760
Come out here!

01:24:06.400 --> 01:24:06.420
Don't!

01:26:00.380 --> 01:26:00.820
Thank you.

01:26:30.640 --> 01:26:31.020
Thank you.

01:27:14.330 --> 01:27:14.750
